      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "description": "`learned_correct`. Tier 1, addressed turns only. The instruction is stored with provenance\n`User` only if it is a contiguous span of the turn's normalised transcript, else after a\n`UserInput` yes as `Approved`; a skill target queues `LearnCmd::Repair`.",
      "properties": {
